### Listar entregas
GET http://localhost:3004/entregas

### Buscar entrega por ID
GET http://localhost:3004/entregas/6af5c4550bef3d20392aa204

### Buscar entrega por pedido
GET http://localhost:3004/entregas/pedido/6af4f2df125ac6ed31b1423a

### Criar entrega
POST http://localhost:3004/entregas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pedidoId": "6af4f2df125ac6ed31b1423a",
  "endereco": "Av. Paulista"
}

### Atualizar entrega
PUT http://localhost:3004/entregas/6af5c4550bef3d20392aa204/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ENVIADO"
}